@@ -0,0 +1,62 @@
+---
+title: "Speaking"
+seoTitle: "Amit Sharma | Keynote Speaker on Product Leadership & Fintech"
+description: "Amit Sharma speaks on fintech product strategy, regulated product decisions, distribution and product-market fit, drawing on 18 years of operating experience."
+layout: "speaking"
+eyebrow: "Keynote speaker · Product leadership"
+heroHeadline: "Product decisions are easy when the answers are obvious. The real work begins when they aren't."
+heroText: "Amit Sharma is a product leader and operator with 18 years of experience across fintech, insurtech, wealth management and digital products. Having led products at Coverfox and ICICI Securities, he speaks about making better product decisions under real-world constraints."
+contactURL: "https://cal.id/amitsharma-product/office-hours"
+formats:
+  - Keynotes
+  - Fireside chats
+  - Workshops
+---
+
+## Talks for people building products in the real world
+
+### 01 · Why Fintech Roadmaps Expand While Clarity Shrinks
+
+For founders, CPOs and product leaders. A practical look at prioritisation, competing stakeholder demands, roadmap bloat, and the difference between shipping and progress.
+
+**Takeaway:** Make trade-offs visible and connect roadmap choices to outcomes, not activity.
+
+### 02 · Product Decisions Under Real Compliance Pressure
+
+For leaders in fintech, insurtech, wealthtech and regulated businesses. Explore decisions at the intersection of compliance, customer needs, commercial outcomes and execution.
+
+**Takeaway:** Bring risk, customer value and delivery constraints into the same decision, early.
+
+### 03 · From 1,000 to 250,000+ Installs: Distribution Lessons from Coverfox
+
+For founders, growth leaders and product managers. How distribution becomes a product problem, from funnel friction and adoption to growth without marketing spend.
+
+**Takeaway:** Look for adoption barriers in the product experience, not only in the campaign plan.
+
+### 04 · The Product-Market Fit Equation for Domain-Heavy Products
+
+For early-stage founders, accelerators and investors. Explore the interaction between technology capability, audience need, willingness to pay, and founder expertise or defensibility.
+
+**Takeaway:** Test whether these elements reinforce one another before scaling the solution.
+
+## Grounded in operating experience
+
+- **Coverfox:** App installs grew from approximately 1,000 to over 250,000 without marketing spend.
+- **ICICI Securities:** Private wealth digital products, including onboarding associated with ₹26 billion in assets under advice.
+- **Product delivery:** Experience reducing deployment cycles by 70%.
+- **Commercial outcomes:** Product changes associated with a 50% increase in average revenue per user.
+
+## Built around your audience
+
+- **Keynotes:** Focused talks with practical insights and actionable takeaways.
+- **Fireside chats:** Candid discussions on product strategy, growth and execution.
+- **Leadership workshops:** Interactive sessions exploring product decisions and operating challenges.
+- **Founder sessions:** Practical sessions on product-market fit, prioritisation and distribution.
+
+## Let's make the session useful.
+
+Every event has a different audience and a different reason for bringing people together. I work with organizers to select the most relevant topic, calibrate the depth of the session and make the content useful to the people in the room.
+
+Share the event, audience, date, location and preferred format to start a conversation.
+
+[Discuss a Speaking Engagement](https://cal.id/amitsharma-product/office-hours)
